  "review": {
    "gallery": "Official website elevation and eight matched images from the developer brochure. The lead retains the crown and podium in the card and gallery crop.",
    "location": "The brochure map and all ten estimate labels were visually checked on physical page 14. The project page identifies Burj Khalifa Boulevard. Directions use the project name because the published map is schematic.",
    "floorPlans": "All 18 complete studio to three-bedroom panels and total areas were checked on the 41-page Binghatti brochure, plus the amenities plan. The [Madena mirror of the separate 11-page plan book](https://www.madena.ae/api/assets/documents/projects/binghatti-skyblade/floor-plans/f7fc2030ad861b79.pdf) has differing totals for some identically labelled types. The selected drawings and numbers stay with the same official brochure edition. Three complete plans from the separately attributed September 2025 engineering set show ground-floor retail, the amenity floor and the roof. The engineering calculation and official marketing totals differ, so they are not combined."
